## Coding (short)
1) Write `reverseString(s)`  
2) Write `sumArray(arr)` using `reduce`  
3) DOM: On button click, change `<p id="msg">` text to "Done"

---

## Answer Key
MCQ: 1)B 2)B 3)C 4)B 5)A 6)B 7)B 8)A 9)B

### Coding solutions
1)
```js
function reverseString(s){ return s.split("").reverse().join(""); }
```
2)
```js
function sumArray(arr){ return arr.reduce((a,x)=>a+x,0); }
```
3)
```js
document.getElementById("btn").addEventListener("click", ()=>{
  document.getElementById("msg").textContent = "Done";
});
```
